I am applying for the Senior Software Engineer, AI Framework Integrations rol=
e at MongoDB. In my work building agentic systems and tool integrations, I fo=
cus on deterministic orchestration, schema-backed interfaces, and reliable mo=
del execution in Python and Node.js. At Black Piano, I developed a custom Mod=
el Context Protocol (MCP) tool that transforms structured Google Sheets data =
into publication-ready content from single-line prompts, alongside a self-hea=
ling Gemini agent that autonomously resolves missing domain records with fall=
back lookup logic and human-in-the-loop escalation.

Beyond production data pipelines, I build open-source agentic developer tooli=
ng and multi-agent harnesses. I authored MyLocalCLI, an npm-published termina=
l coding assistant that integrates eight model providers, forty-two built-in =
tools, parallel execution dispatch, and a Stdio MCP bridge with automated pro=
vider failover. Through independent projects like JobAgents and AgentSwarm, I=
 have engineered Python-based deterministic scoring engines handling thousand=
s of records without model calls, multi-CLI orchestration harnesses, and stri=
ct verification gates that audit tool calls and prevent ungrounded outputs.

MongoDB is uniquely positioned as the foundational operational data and vecto=
r layer powering production RAG and agent architectures across the software i=
ndustry. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my hands-on backgroun=
d with MCP tooling, agent harnesses, and Python integrations can contribute t=
o your framework ecosystem.

